 runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids February to March and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 34 of 75 years. In 2025, August to September came in at 48% of normal on the middle of the grids. In 2026 so far, January to February sat at 61% and February to March at 151% on the middle of the grids. On grid 23586 the driest year was 1987 at 66% of normal.</p>"}
